Six or seven years ago, they promessed never to do that:-).

Anyway, it's worth knowing.  I've learned something which may be
useful (although most of my work today is either C++ or shell
scripts).

I'm still going to experiment a bit more with Swing.  C++
doesn't have anything near as good, even as a third party
add-on.

